text.section:
Except as otherwise provided in subsection D, the Department shall reject an application for a certificate of title only if:

The application does not comply with § 29.1-733.7;


The application does not contain documentation sufficient for the Department to determine whether the applicant is entitled to a certificate;


There is a reasonable basis for concluding that the application is fraudulent or issuance of a certificate would facilitate a fraudulent or illegal act; or


The application does not comply with the law of the Commonwealth other than this article.
